{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00524","headline":"郊庙歌辞 武后大享拜洛乐章 敬和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 武后大享拜洛乐章 敬和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兰俎既昇，苹羞可荐。\n金石载设，咸英已变。\n林泽斯总，山川是遍。\n敢用敷诚，实惟忘倦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00524.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00524","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}